I found two faults, and the travel2 one explains most of the user-visible failures. Output below.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "ts-travel2-service",
      "fault_kind": "pod_failure",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT metric, attr_k8s_pod_name, count(*) n, min(value) mn, max(value) mx FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name LIKE 'ts-travel2%' AND metric='k8s.container.restarts' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "ts-travel2-service pod restart counter is 1 throughout the abnormal window, versus 0 in normal."},
        {"kind": "log", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) c FROM abnormal_logs WHERE level='SEVERE' AND message LIKE '%travel2service%Connection refused%' GROUP BY 1", "claim": "Route-plan and travel-plan SEVERE logs show 'Connection refused' calls to ts-travel2-service on port 8080 (about 74 each)."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) n, sum(CASE WHEN attr_status_code='Error' THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) errs FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND span_name='POST' GROUP BY 1", "claim": "About 74 of 455 route-plan outbound POST calls to travel2 ended in Error status, all in the first minutes."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "service": "ts-station-food-service",
      "fault_kind": "application_method_slow",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) avg_ms, round(max(duration)/1e6,1) max_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-station-food-service' AND span_name LIKE 'StationFoodController%' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "StationFoodController.getFoodStoresByStationNames self-time averages 31.6ms (normal 6.8ms) with a 2.6s max, while its DB spans stay about 1ms."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, sum(CASE WHEN duration>1000000000 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) over1s FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-food-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND duration>1000000000 GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Food-service getAllFood server spans exceed 1s in the abnormal window, following the slow station-food calls."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {
      "from": "ts-travel2-service",
      "to": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-route-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3", "claim": "Route-plan server spans for cheapestRoute, quickestRoute and minStopStations return HTTP 500 after calls to travel2 fail."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-route-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-travel-plan-service' AND attr_span_kind='Client' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "Travel-plan POST calls to route-plan return 500 with Error status, matching the route-plan failures."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-travel-plan-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND attr_span_kind='Server' AND attr_status_code='Error' GROUP BY 1,2,3,4", "claim": "UI-dashboard travelPlan endpoints return HTTP 500 when travel-plan fails, reaching the user-facing tier."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-station-food-service",
      "to": "ts-food-service",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, count(*) n, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-food-service' AND span_name='POST' AND attr_span_kind='Client' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "Food-service POST calls to station-food average 36ms in abnormal versus 11ms in normal."}
      ]
    },
    {
      "from": "ts-food-service",
      "to": "ts-ui-dashboard",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, round(avg(duration)/1e6,1) ms, round(max(duration)/1e6,1) mx FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='ts-ui-dashboard' AND span_name LIKE '%foodservice%' AND attr_span_kind='Server' GROUP BY 1,2", "claim": "UI-dashboard food endpoints slow down, with some requests over 2.7s, following food-service getAllFood delays."}
      ]
    }
